BT /F2 13.5 Tf 0.02 0.44 0.50 rg 1 0 0 1 50 710 Tm (DISK READ PATH / ENGINEERING NOTES) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 678 Tm (1. Begin with the ext-family superblock and feature flags. Ext3 retains the familiar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 661.5 Tm (block groups, inode tables and directory structures of ext2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 635 Tm (2. Locate the journal, normally associated with a reserved inode or an external journal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 618.5 Tm (device, and confirm its metadata before replay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 592 Tm (3. Interpret journal descriptor, commit and revoke records using JBD's record format. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 575.5 Tm (incomplete or uncommitted transaction must not become live metadata.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 549 Tm (4. Distinguish ordered, writeback and journalled data modes; they express different) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 532.5 Tm (guarantees about user data versus metadata updates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 506 Tm (5. Apply metadata replay to a consistent ext filesystem image before relying on bitmaps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 489.5 Tm (or directories. A clean-looking inode table alone is not enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 463 Tm (6. Resolve inode data through the block pointer mapping appropriate to its feature set;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 446.5 Tm (ext3 does not automatically imply ext4 extent trees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 420 Tm (7. Read file and directory records using the versioned ext format, including directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 403.5 Tm (index features when enabled.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 377 Tm (8. Keep external journal identity and feature compatibility separate from ordinary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 55 360.5 Tm (block-device addresses; a missing external journal changes recovery possibilities.) Tj ET
